    "detailed_description": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>Immerse yourself in this short, yet compelling 2D pixel art adventure in <i>Central Killing Agency</i>. As an agent of the compromised Central Killing Agency, your mission is to eliminate lead scientist Fred Olsen, navigating branching dialogues to shape your fate.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Setting: It takes place in a 1950's hotel and is a 2D pixel art game.<br>    </li><li>Short &amp; Sweet: Experience a compact yet impactful narrative-driven experience.<br>    </li><li>Branching Dialogue: Navigate the various dialogue options to unlock the alternative endings.<br>    </li><li>Alternate Endings: Explore the various alternate endings to the game.<br>    </li><li>Engaging Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in the captivating musical score.</li></ul><br><strong>Attributions<strong><br>German translation by Yustin Ogrodowski</strong></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>Immerse yourself in this short, yet compelling 2D pixel art adventure in <i>Central Killing Agency</i>. As an agent of the compromised Central Killing Agency, your mission is to eliminate lead scientist Fred Olsen, navigating branching dialogues to shape your fate.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Setting: It takes place in a 1950's hotel and is a 2D pixel art game.<br>    </li><li>Short &amp; Sweet: Experience a compact yet impactful narrative-driven experience.<br>    </li><li>Branching Dialogue: Navigate the various dialogue options to unlock the alternative endings.<br>    </li><li>Alternate Endings: Explore the various alternate endings to the game.<br>    </li><li>Engaging Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in the captivating musical score.</li></ul><br><strong>Attributions<strong><br>German translation by Yustin Ogrodowski</strong></strong>",
    "short_description": "In this 2d pixel art game, it's 1953 and you're playing as an agent hired by the Central Killing Agency to kill Fred Olsen. Experience multiple endings in this short, narrative-driven adventure.",
